---
const cards = [
  {
    icon: 'purple',
    glow: 'purple-glow',
    title: 'Built To Be Answered',
    description:
      'Customers increasingly ask an AI assistant which business to use instead of typing a search. A site that states clearly what you do, where you are, and how to reach you is far easier for those systems to describe accurately.',
    iconSvg: '<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg>',
  },
  {
    icon: 'mint',
    glow: 'mint-glow',
    title: 'Fast On Real Devices',
    description:
      'Most people will judge your business on a phone, on mobile data, often while doing something else. Every concept site I build is checked on real screen sizes before anyone sees it, and I will show you the numbers rather than promise a figure.',
    iconSvg: '<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>',
  },
  {
    icon: 'white',
    glow: 'purple-glow',
    title: 'Honest, Findable Detail',
    description:
      'Your name, address, phone, services, and hours stated the same way everywhere. Inconsistent information is one of the most common reasons a business gets left out or described wrongly in search and AI results.',
    iconSvg: '<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>',
  },
];
---

<section id="why-modern" class="svc-row dot-pattern reveal">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px">
      <div class="section-title">Why your site is <span class="gradient-text">not working</span></div>
      <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin:0 auto">If your website is not producing enquiries, the problem is usually one of three things. Here is how I would start looking for it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-row-grid">
      {cards.map(card => (
        <div class={`svc-row-card glass ${card.glow}`}>
          <div class={`svc-row-icon ${card.icon}`} set:html={card.iconSvg} />
          <h3>{card.title}</h3>
          <p>{card.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
